00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:09,750
The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind is a drama, history
film directed by Chiwetel Ejiofor.

2
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:13,500
Against all the odds, a thirteen year old boy in Malawi invents an
unconventional way to save his family and village from famine.

