9
01:03:33,750 --> 01:03:39,750
The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind is a 2019 drama film written, directed by and
starring Chiwetel Ejiofor in his feature directorial debut.

10
01:10:37,500 --> 01:10:43,500
The film is based on the memoir of the same name by
William Kamkwamba and Bryan Mealer.

11
01:17:41,250 --> 01:17:47,250
It was screened in the Premieres section at the 2019 Sundance Film Festival and
began streaming in most territories on Netflix on 1 March 2019.

12
01:24:45,000 --> 01:24:51,000
It was selected as the British entry for the Best International Feature
Film at the 92nd Academy Awards, but it was not nominated.

13
01:31:48,750 --> 01:31:54,750
It received widely positive reviews with praise going
to Ejiofor's direction and the acting.

14
01:38:52,500 --> 01:38:58,500
The film explores themes of africa, windmill, based on true
story, family power struggle, water for life.

15
01:45:56,250 --> 01:46:02,250
The tone is emotional.
